<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Prompt Used for Generating Auxiliary Traces</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use the following prompt for the annotation model to generate reasoning that’s used to construct auxiliary traces as described in Section <a href="#S3.SS3" title="3.3 Generating Training Data ‣ 3 SideQuest ‣ SideQuest: Model-Driven KV Cache Management for Long-Horizon Agentic Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.3</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<div id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F9F9F9;"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">I</span><span id="lstnumberx1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">will</span><span id="lstnumberx1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">provide</span><span id="lstnumberx1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">you</span><span id="lstnumberx1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">with</span><span id="lstnumberx1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx1.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">**</span><span id="lstnumberx1.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Task</span><span id="lstnumberx1.15" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">**,</span><span id="lstnumberx1.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx1.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.19" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">**</span><span id="lstnumberx1.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Partial</span><span id="lstnumberx1.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Conversation</span><span id="lstnumberx1.23" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">**</span><span id="lstnumberx1.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.25" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><span id="lstnumberx1.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">the</span><span id="lstnumberx1.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">history</span><span id="lstnumberx1.29" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">),</span><span id="lstnumberx1.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">and</span><span id="lstnumberx1.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.33" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">the</span><span id="lstnumberx1.34" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.35" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">**</span><span id="lstnumberx1.36" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Solution</span><span id="lstnumberx1.37" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">**.</span><span id="lstnumberx1.38" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.39" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">I</span><span id="lstnumberx1.40" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.41" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">want</span><span id="lstnumberx1.42" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.43" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">you</span><span id="lstnumberx1.44" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.45" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">to</span><span id="lstnumberx1.46" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.47" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">create</span><span id="lstnumberx1.48" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.49" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx1.50" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.51" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">synthetic</span><span id="lstnumberx1.52" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.53" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">reasoning</span><span id="lstnumberx1.54" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.55" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">content</span><span id="lstnumberx1.56" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.57" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">for</span><span id="lstnumberx1.58" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.59" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">the</span><span id="lstnumberx1.60" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.61" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">task</span><span id="lstnumberx1.62" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.63" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">leads</span><span id="lstnumberx1.64" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.65" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">to</span><span id="lstnumberx1.66" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.67" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">the</span><span id="lstnumberx1.68" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.69" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">provided</span><span id="lstnumberx1.70" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.71" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">solution</span><span id="lstnumberx1.72" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">.</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx2" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx3" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">**</span><span id="lstnumberx3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Your</span><span id="lstnumberx3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Objective</span><span id="lstnumberx3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">:**</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx4" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Generate</span><span id="lstnumberx4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">concise</span><span id="lstnumberx4.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">reasoning</span><span id="lstnumberx4.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">trace</span><span id="lstnumberx4.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">that</span><span id="lstnumberx4.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">an</span><span id="lstnumberx4.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">agent</span><span id="lstnumberx4.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">would</span><span id="lstnumberx4.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">think</span><span id="lstnumberx4.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.21" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">*</span><span id="lstnumberx4.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">in</span><span id="lstnumberx4.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">the</span><span id="lstnumberx4.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">moment</span><span id="lstnumberx4.27" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">*</span><span id="lstnumberx4.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">to</span><span id="lstnumberx4.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">distinguish</span><span id="lstnumberx4.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.33" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">between</span><span id="lstnumberx4.34" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.35" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">cursors</span><span id="lstnumberx4.36" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.37" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">that</span><span id="lstnumberx4.38" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.39" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">are</span><span id="lstnumberx4.40" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.41" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">still</span><span id="lstnumberx4.42" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.43" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">valuable</span><span id="lstnumberx4.44" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.45" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">versus</span><span id="lstnumberx4.46" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.47" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">those</span><span id="lstnumberx4.48" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.49" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">that</span><span id="lstnumberx4.50" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.51" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">are</span><span id="lstnumberx4.52" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.53" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">now</span><span id="lstnumberx4.54" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.55" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">just</span><span id="lstnumberx4.56" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx4.57" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">noise</span><span id="lstnumberx4.58" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">.</span>
